Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.30,0:01:26.50,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord6}On and on the Great River rolls, racing east.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.50,0:01:35.70,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k61}Làng{\k69}huā {\k117}táo{\k107}jǐn {\k105}yīng{\k464}xióng
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.50,0:01:35.70,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord6}Of proud and gallant heroes its white-waves leave no trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.74,0:01:44.82,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k67}Shì{\k111}fēi {\k76}chéng{\k104}bài {\k129}zhuǎn{\k242}tóu{\k195}kōng
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.74,0:01:44.82,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord6}As right and wrong, glory and fall,\N fade at once into unreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.94,0:01:49.22,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k69}Qīng{\k63}shān {\k40}yī{\k80}jiù {\k175}zài
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.94,0:01:49.22,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord6}Yet ever the green hills stay,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.30,0:01:54.86,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k85}Jǐ{\k78}dù {\k58}xī{\k64}yáng{\k271}hóng
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.30,0:01:54.86,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord6}to blaze in the west-waning day.
