Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.38,0:02:10.70,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord6}Fishers and woodsmen comb on the river isles,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.78,0:02:18.58,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k50}Guàn{\k46}kàn {\k102}qiū{\k103}yuè {\k166}chūn{\k313}fēng
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.78,0:02:18.58,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord6}White-crowned, looking on \Nthe autumn moons and spring breezes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.74,0:02:27.14,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k74}Yī{\k124}hú {\k120}zhuó{\k114}jiǔ {\k64}xǐ{\k167}xiāng{\k177}féng
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.74,0:02:27.14,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord6}With a jar of wine, they merrily gather.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.30,0:02:30.10,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k38}Gǔ{\k64}jīn {\k48}duō{\k70}shǎo {\k60}shì
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.30,0:02:30.10,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord6}The countless tales of present and past,
