Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.00,0:03:21.16,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,1150,4100,5140)\pos(653.755,574.455)}The Retreat to Màichéng
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.38,0:04:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, there are ships coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.62,0:04:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare the tinder!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.18,0:04:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The tinder is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.22,0:04:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.26,0:04:39.70,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,6100,6420)\pos(332.8,497.6)}Lǚ Méng\NStyled: Zǐmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.50,0:04:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Order the troops in every ship on standby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.58,0:04:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who exposes us must be executed at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.66,0:04:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.26,0:04:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Orders from Grand Marshal Lü: be on standby, do not act rashly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.22,0:04:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who exposes us will be executed at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.42,0:04:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.86,0:05:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here? \NNo mooring is allowed here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.14,0:05:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, we are merchants!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.38,0:05:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The wind and waves are fierce! \NWe'll take refuge then go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.14,0:05:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No! This beacon tower is an important place!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.82,0:05:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No ship may moor here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.86,0:05:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, please allow this exception!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.38,0:05:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't stay for long! We'll leave after the wind and waves pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.86,0:05:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What's on the ships?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.18,0:05:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Pottery and brocades, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.22,0:05:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine! Leave when the wind and waves subside! Do not stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.34,0:05:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.50,0:05:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Put out the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.94,0:06:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, who are these-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.38,0:07:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Up! Dress up and go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.46,0:07:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.66,0:07:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.90,0:08:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, the 20,000 troops \Nfrom Jing Province have been organized.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.90,0:08:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.22,0:08:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, we can attack Fancheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.86,0:08:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Order all officers to the tent for a conference.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.58,0:08:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.58,0:08:57.42,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(353.6,88)}Jīng Province
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.78,0:09:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.86,0:09:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.22,0:09:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It is us! Lower the drawbridge! Open the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.06,0:09:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Light the torch!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.54,0:09:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.50,0:09:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Light the torches! Let them identify us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.70,0:09:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you identify us now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.06,0:09:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the gate now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.50,0:09:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They're our own. Open the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.98,0:09:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.66,0:10:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Rush into the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.22,0:10:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Close the gate! Hurry and close the gate! Lift the drawbridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.14,0:10:54.54,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2020,2380)\pos(337.333,460)}Sūn Quán\NStyled: Zhòngmóu
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.86,0:11:16.14,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2270,2270)\pos(929.333,469.333)}Lù Xùn\NStyled: Bóyán
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.06,0:11:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, according to the scouts...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.42,0:11:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.22,0:12:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The Wu army has taken Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.78,0:12:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think of this situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.90,0:12:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The Wu army took Jing Province so quickly because Jing Province must be empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.50,0:12:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be Guan Yu moving the troops of Jing northwards
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.38,0:12:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,to attack Fancheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.34,0:12:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, I believe that\N Fancheng is in even greater danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.70,0:12:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Ren is straining his neck to seek help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.82,0:13:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps we should write a letter about this situation and have it shot into Fancheng
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.18,0:13:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,so that morale may be boosted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.70,0:13:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We should also find a way to let Guan Yu \Nknow that Eastern Wu has seized Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.78,0:13:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Guan Yu would lead his troops southwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.86,0:13:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,With that, order Xu Huang to pursue him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.14,0:13:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Total victory will be guaranteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.54,0:13:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wenhe, your plan is to my liking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.10,0:13:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Send a man to tell Xu Huang to sally forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.22,0:13:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.18,0:13:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Xu Gongming?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.38,0:13:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Marquis, after years of separation,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.42,0:13:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}never did I imagine seeing your hair turn white!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.82,0:13:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Remembering our time together in our prime,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.42,0:13:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}I have learned much from you. \NI am thankful and will never forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.82,0:14:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Gongming, you exaggerate!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.94,0:14:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Marquis, your heroic might is esteemed by everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.34,0:14:06.46,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2270,2270)\pos(986.667,510.667)}Xú Huǎng\NStyled: Gōngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.54,0:14:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}and all your acquaintances \Nfeel envy when they hear of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.58,0:14:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}To have this encounter \Nmakes me overjoyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.02,0:14:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}We have a deep relationship unlike any other.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.30,0:14:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Yet why, at this juncture, \Ndo you threaten my son Guan Ping?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.26,0:14:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever beheads Guan Yu will \Nbe rewarded one thousand pieces of gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.58,0:14:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongming, why do you say this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.74,0:14:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Our meeting on the battlefield is a state matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.62,0:14:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I dare not abandon it for a private one!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.34,0:14:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.18,0:14:42.18,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(292,476)}Zhōu Cāng
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.78,0:14:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ring the bell! Ring the bell!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.94,0:14:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Guan Ping, my son, come fight Xu Huang with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.18,0:15:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Liao Hua and Wang Pu, lead the rear army to fight Cao Ren!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.74,0:15:06.06,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1980,2300)\pos(314,389.333)}Guān Píng
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.78,0:15:29.02,Thinking,,0,0,0,,At this moment, Cao Ren \Nrushed out of Fancheng with an army
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.02,0:15:31.30,Thinking,,0,0,0,,to make a pincer attack against the Shu army.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.30,0:15:34.70,Thinking,,0,0,0,,The Shu army was attacked on two sides and could not fend them off,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.70,0:15:37.34,Thinking,,0,0,0,,so they retreated to Gong'an.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.34,0:15:40.94,Thinking,,0,0,0,,However, the garrison general \Nhad given the city to Eastern Wu,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.94,0:15:43.22,Thinking,,0,0,0,,so they retreated to Nan Commandery.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.22,0:15:47.82,Thinking,,0,0,0,,However, the man sent to Nan Commandery to urge for provisions had not reported back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.06,0:15:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, how is the wound?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.98,0:16:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.18,0:16:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,General, where do you desire to go now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.86,0:16:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Recuperate for now, then engage in a decisive battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.10,0:16:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.90,0:16:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Jing Province was taken by Lü Meng \Nof Eastern Wu, and your household was captured!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.70,0:16:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Sun Quan is already in Jing Province!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.02,0:16:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Can this be true?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.98,0:16:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}I snuck into Jing Province, {\bord14\pos(640,670)}I saw and heard it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.62,0:16:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Lü Meng's illness and Lu Xun's reassignment to guard Lukou were all ruses!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.26,0:17:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell for those villains' devious plotting!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.66,0:17:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-Father!\N-General Guan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.18,0:17:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Return to Gong'an for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.74,0:18:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.70,0:18:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, that is Provision Marshal Zhao Lei.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.94,0:18:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be back from Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.50,0:18:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guan, why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.06,0:18:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I am going to Gong'an.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.38,0:18:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Fu Shiren of Gong'an surrendered to Eastern Wu!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.54,0:18:26.26,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1705,1705)\pos(974.667,324)}Zhào Lěi
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.50,0:18:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.42,0:18:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Fu Shiren then went to Nan Commandery and\N killed the man urging for provisions!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.94,0:18:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He also entreated Mi Fang \Nto surrender to Eastern Wu!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.46,0:18:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.74,0:18:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-Father!\N-General Guan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.18,0:18:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-General Guan!\N-Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.62,0:18:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.18,0:19:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Major Wang...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.14,0:19:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.02,0:19:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I regret not heeding your words.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.42,0:19:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Not assigning an able man to supervise \NJing Province caused our present defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.66,0:19:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Marshal Zhao.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.98,0:19:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.86,0:20:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I built beacon towers along the Yangzi river long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.98,0:20:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did they not light the fires \Nwhen the Eastern Wu troops came?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.50,0:20:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Lü Meng had his men dress in white and \Ncross the river disguised as merchants.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.46,0:20:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He hid elite troops in the cabins and\N captured the tower guards during the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.70,0:20:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hence, the fires were not lit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.42,0:20:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That underhanded brigand!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.54,0:20:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-General!\N-Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.30,0:20:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, the nine commanderies in Jing Province...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.70,0:20:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,have all fallen into enemy hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.38,0:20:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I bear to face my elder brother now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.14,0:20:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-General Guan!\N-Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.18,0:20:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.58,0:22:35.42,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Guan Yu was forced to lead the remaining forces to Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.42,0:22:39.46,Thinking,,0,0,0,,On the way, he was repeatedly intercepted by Wu troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.46,0:22:44.22,Thinking,,0,0,0,,He had no alternative but to move towards Maicheng to seek shelter temporarily
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.22,0:22:48.14,Thinking,,0,0,0,,in order to wait for reinforcements \Nfrom the Riverlands.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.14,0:22:50.54,Thinking,,0,0,0,,However, they were so far, far away,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.54,0:22:53.34,Thinking,,0,0,0,,they could not easily arrive in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.34,0:22:57.10,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, the troops of Eastern Wu surrounded Maicheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.78,0:23:04.10,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Guan Yu wrote a letter to Liu Feng and Meng Da, \Nthe guarding generals of Shangyong, to seek help.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.14,0:23:05.06,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4540,4900)\pos(942.667,450.667)}Màichéng
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.30,0:23:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The Western Riverlands is so far, far away,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.70,0:23:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,reinforcements cannot easily arrive in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.34,0:23:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot wait to die in this isolated city!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.90,0:23:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Generals!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.62,0:23:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-General Liao.\N-Generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.98,0:23:35.18,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2820,3180)\pos(470.667,482.667)}Liào Huà\NStyled: Yuánjiǎn
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.38,0:23:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Guan Yu is trapped in Maicheng after his defeat. This is urgent.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.62,0:23:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Aid from Shu is yet to arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.70,0:23:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He ordered me to seek help.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.34,0:23:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You must raise troops now as reinforcement.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.86,0:23:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Any tarry or delay,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.50,0:23:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and General Guan will fall into enemy hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.22,0:23:54.78,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2180,2540)\pos(349.333,505.333)}Mèng Dá\NStyled: Zǐqìng
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.86,0:23:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,General Liao, please rest in the manor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.22,0:24:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow General Meng and I to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.66,0:24:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you two will make arrangements soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.46,0:24:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Aid from Shangyong should have arrived today.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.90,0:24:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is there no sign of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.02,0:24:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Marshal Zhao.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.02,0:24:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.02,0:24:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How are our provisions?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.74,0:24:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no food in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.70,0:24:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How about the soldiers?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.50,0:24:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There are only five or six hundred people in total. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.10,0:24:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,many are wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.26,0:24:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You see General Guan as your uncle,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.46,0:25:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,but what if he does not see you as his nephew?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.70,0:25:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,General, what do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.58,0:25:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}I have heard that years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.18,0:25:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}when the King of Hanzhong adopted you,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.42,0:25:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}General Guan was already quite displeased.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.06,0:25:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}And when the King took his throne,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.78,0:25:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}he thought you could be the heir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.38,0:25:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}He asked Kongming, and Kongming said,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.66,0:25:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}"This is a personal matter. Ask Guan and Zhang."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.66,0:25:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}So the King sent a man to Jing Province to ask Guan Yu.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.06,0:25:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}And the response?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.46,0:25:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Guan Yu said,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.54,0:25:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}"He is a {\u0\i1}mínglíng{\u0\i0} child and must not be made heir!"
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.54,0:25:40.34,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mínglíng{\i0} child (螟蛉): It means "foster child." It is caterpillar larvae said to be carried by the potter wasp ({\i1}guǒluǒ,{\i0} 蜾蠃) to be raised.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.14,0:25:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.34,0:25:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Guan Yu also urged the King to send you far away into this remote mountain city of Shangyong
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.66,0:25:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}to prevent future trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.14,0:25:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guan!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.26,0:26:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there aid?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.50,0:26:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.46,0:26:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Jin, the Chief Secretary of Eastern Wu, came to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.10,0:26:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Jin?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.74,0:26:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Invite him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.54,0:26:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Zhuge Jin is invited!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.98,0:26:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guan!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.82,0:26:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ziyu, for what purpose do you come today?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.58,0:26:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The Marquis of Wu ordered me to give you advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.66,0:26:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.74,0:26:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,As old wisdom says, he who can suit his actions to the time is wise.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.62,0:26:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you know of your present situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.46,0:26:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And that present situation is?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.50,0:26:51.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Today, the nine commanderies of Jing you administered all belong to others.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.50,0:26:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Only this petty, single, and isolated city stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.46,0:26:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,With no food inside and no aid outside, it is in peril.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.86,0:27:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Your situation is cause for concern!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.14,0:27:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What, in your opinion, should be done?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.42,0:27:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,General, the Marquis of Wu is a brilliant master.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.86,0:27:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,His virtue and talent are no less than Imperial \NUncle Liu. He will soon achieve his great cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.90,0:27:21.34,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3100,3420)\pos(333.333,512)}Zhūgě Jǐn\NStyled: Zǐyú
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.86,0:27:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The Marquis of Wu has always admired you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.26,0:27:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,General, you are a sensible man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.70,0:27:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not join him before Maicheng is breached?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.30,0:27:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, you can reorganize \NJing and protect your household.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.98,0:27:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Please consider this carefully, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.70,0:27:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}How can Sun Quan, a brigand, be on par with the King of Hanzhong, my elder brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.10,0:27:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}I am but a warrior from Xieliang
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.82,0:27:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}who happens to be treated as a brother by my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.62,0:28:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Our brotherhood has lasted over \Nthirty years since the Peach Garden Oath
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.50,0:28:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}without a bit of suspicion.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.22,0:28:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}The King of Hanzhzong has bestowed me a great task,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.98,0:28:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}and trust as heavy as mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.70,0:28:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}I am a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.66,0:28:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}How could I betray that bond to defect?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.06,0:28:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}If the city falls, then I will fall with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.42,0:28:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Jade may be shattered, but its whiteness remains;
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.14,0:28:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}bamboo may be burned, \Nbut its joints stand straight!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.74,0:28:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Though my body may be broken,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.54,0:28:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}my name shall remain!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.34,0:28:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}What is there to be afraid of!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.90,0:28:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Marquis!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.34,0:28:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Say no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.74,0:28:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Marquis!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.38,0:28:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.66,0:28:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I vow to fight against Sun Quan to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.82,0:28:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Marquis!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.34,0:28:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The Marquis of Wu truly has the best intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.62,0:29:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants to build the Bond of {\i1}Qín{\i0} and {\i1}Jìn{\i0} with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.62,0:29:06.02,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Bond of {\i1}Qín{\i0} and {\i1}Jìn{\i0} (秦晋之好): Refers to matrimonial ties in reference to the states of {\i1}Qín{\i0}（秦） and {\i1}Jìn{\i0}（晋） of the Spring and Autumn Period.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.18,0:29:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,to defeat Cao Cao and restore the Han Dynasty together.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.18,0:29:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He has no other motive.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.42,0:29:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, must you be so stubborn?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.58,0:29:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence! Do not slander my father!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.70,0:29:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Young general, young general...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.22,0:29:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.30,0:29:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ziyu's younger brother, Kongming,\Nis serving the King of Hanzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.30,0:29:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Would killing him not hurt the Strategos' heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.06,0:29:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.02,0:29:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.46,0:29:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Marquis! Marquis!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.10,0:29:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.42,0:29:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.82,0:29:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.10,0:29:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Send him out of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.46,0:29:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.70,0:29:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What a loyal liegeman Guan Yunchang is!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.30,0:29:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ziming, what should be done in this situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.70,0:29:57.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My lord, the situation today is unlike \Nthe lone banquet with Guan Yu before.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.46,0:30:01.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Even if he sprouted wings, he could not escape the trap that I deployed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.58,0:30:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What great plan do you have, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.94,0:30:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I reckon Guan Yu will soon be forced to abandon the city and flee.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.34,0:30:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So what if Guan Yu abandons the city?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.26,0:30:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Guan Yu, with so few troops,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.10,0:30:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}will not escape through major roads.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.58,0:30:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}To the north of Maicheng, there is \Nan arduous path to the Western Riverlands.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.98,0:30:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Guan Yu will certainly use this path.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.26,0:30:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Have Zhu Ran lay an ambush with five thousand elite soldiers, twenty {\i1}li{\i0} to the north of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.74,0:30:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Once the enemy arrives, do not engage.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.02,0:30:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Follow it and attack it from the rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.46,0:30:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Their army will be demoralized and flee to Linju.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.30,0:30:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Have Pan Zhang lead five hundred elite soldiers
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.34,0:30:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}to lay an ambush by the \Nmountainous path near Linju.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.82,0:30:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Thus, Guan Yu will be captured!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.74,0:30:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Good! I will act according to your strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.06,0:31:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}Order the officers to attack every gate of Maicheng,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.42,0:31:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}save for the northern gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.30,0:31:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}We will wait for Guan Yu to exit through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.02,0:31:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.94,0:31:53.58,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3000,3640)\pos(967.143,460.286)}Wáng Pǔ
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.14,0:31:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guan, all the provisions in the city have been consumed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.58,0:31:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There were five to six hundred soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.42,0:32:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,After a count, only three hundred or so are left.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.10,0:32:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I regret not heeding your words.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.06,0:32:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The situation is critical today.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.46,0:32:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What plans do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.58,0:32:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,At this point, even Jiang Ziya \Nreborn would not have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.58,0:32:27.50,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Jiāng Zǐyá (姜子牙): A strategist and minister of the Zhou Dynasty. Author of {\i1}The Six Secret Teachings{\i0} (六韜), a treatise on civil and military strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.90,0:32:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-Father, Father!\N-General Guan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.82,0:33:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Our losses are solely my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.06,0:33:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I was given immense trust by the King of Hanzhong
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.46,0:33:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,to guard Jing Province, but now...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.30,0:33:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only repay him with death.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.02,0:33:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-Father!\N-General Guan!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.78,0:33:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,As Guan Ping is my son, \Nhe will accompany me dead or alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.26,0:33:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You all have families, with old and young relatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.26,0:33:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Before the city falls tonight, masquerade \Nas civilians and pursue your own courses.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.26,0:33:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Marquis, we are willing to follow you dead or alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.38,0:33:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Marquis, why say such words?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.78,0:33:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Marquis, we pledge to follow you with our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.66,0:33:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather we have our bodies and bones\N be crushed than renege on our words!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.46,0:33:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We swear to follow you \Nto fight Sun Quan to the death!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.14,0:34:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Generals, please rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.14,0:34:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Please rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.30,0:34:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Marquis, the absence of aid from Shangyong
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.78,0:34:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,must be due to Liu Feng and Meng Da standing down their forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.02,0:34:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Aid from Shu cannot be hoped for, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.46,0:34:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not leave this lone city, rush to the Riverlands,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.38,0:34:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and reorganize the troops to plan for a counterattack?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.14,0:34:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I have thought of this also.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.86,0:34:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, some enemy troops are at the northern gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.46,0:34:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,According to the citizens,\N a small path north of the city leads to Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.70,0:34:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We will use that path tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.26,0:34:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There may be ambushes along it. \NWe should use the major road.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.38,0:34:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if there are ambushes, what do I have to fear?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.10,0:34:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Orders! All military personnel, \Norganize your attire and prepare to leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.46,0:34:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.34,0:35:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, the troops are ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.30,0:36:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to break out!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.78,0:36:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.86,0:36:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guan.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.50,0:36:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,General Wang.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.98,0:36:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Move out at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.90,0:36:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall stay with one hundred troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.54,0:36:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We will defend this city with our lives, to stall the foe.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.10,0:36:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We will stop them from chasing you, Marquis.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.38,0:36:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.70,0:36:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,General, is this not seeking your own demise?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.62,0:36:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I have followed you for eight years.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.26,0:36:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I have learned very much and \Nmy lifelong wish has been fulfilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.78,0:37:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I will die without any regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.78,0:37:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if the city falls, we will not surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.02,0:37:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Wang Pu, only hope\N you will come back and save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.78,0:37:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,General Wang.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.66,0:37:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Marquis, be vigilant and take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.62,0:37:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.34,0:37:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Time is short. Please mount your horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.82,0:37:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Marquis, please mount!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.10,0:37:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,General Wang, please rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.14,0:37:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhou Cang!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.26,0:37:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.30,0:37:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay here as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.62,0:38:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.66,0:38:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Defend this city with General Wang.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.74,0:38:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guan!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.34,0:38:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I followed you for many years!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.62,0:38:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The trip to the Western Riverlands will be dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.34,0:38:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot stay in the city, I must not abandon you!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.90,0:38:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,With Guan Ping following, \Nnothing will go wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.62,0:38:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,General Wang leads troops by himself, defending the city will be a heavy task.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.90,0:38:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guan...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.94,0:38:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Your staying can give him a firm hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.98,0:38:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Zhou Cang, do not know when I can serve you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.54,0:39:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My good brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.46,0:39:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guan!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.34,0:39:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Good brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.62,0:40:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mount!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.62,0:41:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.78,0:41:35.62,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Guan Yu, leading just over one hundred remaining soldiers,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.62,0:41:39.02,Thinking,,0,0,0,,pushed out of the northern pass and advanced, blade in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.78,0:41:41.82,Thinking,,0,0,0,,After walking for about twenty {\i1}li,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.82,0:41:45.14,Thinking,,0,0,0,,he was ambushed by Zhu Ran of Eastern Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.14,0:41:48.70,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Guan Yu, unwilling to fight,\N retreated towards a small path.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.66,0:41:53.98,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Zhao Lei had already died among the army in the chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.50,0:42:50.10,Thinking,,0,0,0,,The number of soldiers accompanying\N Guan Yu had dwindled to just over ten men.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.02,0:42:58.14,Thinking,,0,0,0,,A disheartened Guan Yu ordered Guan Ping \Nto guard the rear while he opened a way in the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.18,0:43:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.74,0:43:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!

